        "2916552a-4524-4aff-acbc-634e4afb6d00": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Cairo",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Cairo, with its millennia-old history, is home to some of the world's most extraordinary ancient wonders, including the Great Pyramid of Giza and the Great Sphinx. As the bustling capital of Egypt, Cairo showcases timeless charm and serves as a cultural, historical, and political hub of significant global importance.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/egypt-tour-day-cairo.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "aaa35b1a-8f7f-40b4-88b2-307c26dd6c43": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Luxor",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Luxor is renowned for its unparalleled wealth of ancient Egyptian temples and monuments, earning it the title of the \"world's greatest open-air museum.\" This city stands as a living testament to ancient history and civilization, captivating and inspiring visitors from around the globe with its historical richness and grandeur.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/luxor-1200x800.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "643bace9-4996-4be4-b931-2de728a157a3": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Valley of the Kings",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Valley of the Kings is celebrated as the final resting place of numerous ancient Egyptian pharaohs, among them the renowned Tutankhamun. This ancient necropolis holds profound historical significance, continuing to captivate the world's imagination with its discovery of stunning tombs filled with treasures.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Valley_of_the_Kings.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "cab40b70-71f5-4157-900c-344ccf2d5e06": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Giza Plateau",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Giza Plateau is adorned with extraordinary megaliths, notably the Great Sphinx and the pyramids. It also offers important clues to an alternative Egyptian history; researchers have identified unmistakable signs of water erosion on the bedrock where the Sphinx was carved, hinting at its pre-dynastic origins.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Giza_Plateau_2.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        },
        "bd48c292-e8fb-405b-9fc2-3e92ec363226": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "parent_column": "right",
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The Great Pyramid",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Aligned with remarkable precision to Earth’s cardinal directions, the Great Pyramid stands as an unparalleled architectural marvel. Though traditionally attributed to the Egyptian Old Kingdom Pharaoh Khufu (also known as Cheops), its original construction remains shrouded in mystery, as no remains have ever been found from that era.</p>",
            "dropdown_html": "<ul>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n<li>Use this text to answer questions in as much detail as possible for your customers.</li>\n</ul>",
            "dropdown_image": "shopify://shop_images/Great_Pyramid_2.jpg",
            "background_color": "#2e2767",
            "text_color": "#f4f5f7"
          }
        }
      },
