        "cf73ead0-1d61-4710-911f-92abbd89cd91": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Egypt Tour Itinerary",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "57393d7c-eaea-43e6-934b-e35643791451": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 1: Welcome to Cairo, November 17th",
            "text": "<p>Upon arrival at Cairo Airport, you will be greeted by a Saba Tours agent and transferred to the Marriott Mena House Hotel. Take some time to relax before joining your fellow explorers for an introductory meeting and a preview of the journey ahead.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/egypt-tour-day-1-1200x800.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Arrival at Cairo Airport</li><li>Meet the Saba Tours assistant & transfer to the Marriott Mena House Hotel</li><li>Introductory meeting at 6:00 PM</li><li>Welcome dinner</li><li>Overnight at Marriott Mena House</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "46f98c92-e505-4141-a9a0-fa35c3e1337c": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 2: Giza Plateau, November 18th",
            "text": "<p>Today, we explore the renowned Giza Plateau, where you'll stand in awe before the Great Pyramids of Giza, marvel at the mysteries of the Valley Temple, and enjoy a private sunrise visit to the Sphinx.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Giza_Plateau.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Private sunrise visit to the Sphinx enclosure</li><li>Breakfast at the hotel</li><li>Drive to Sakkara</li><li>Visit the Imhotep Museum (newly opened)</li><li>Explore the Serapeum</li><li>Visit the Step Pyramid Complex and go beneath the Step Pyramid</li><li>Lunch at Sakkara restaurant</li><li>Drive to Dahshur</li><li>Visit the Red Pyramid</li><li>Overnight at Mena House</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "665f407f-c58f-4cfe-8e14-b0c7e48b8013": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 3: Luxor/ Karnak Temple, November 19th",
            "text": "<p>Fly to Luxor and delve into the legendary Karnak Temple, exploring its Open Air Museum.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Karnak.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions:</strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast box</li><li>Check out and drive to Cairo Airport</li><li>Fly to Luxor</li><li>Visit Karnak Temple</li><li>Explore the Open-Air Museum at Karnak</li><li>Visit the Chapel of Seven Gates</li><li>Lunch at Al Kersh</li><li>Visit Luxor Temple</li><li>Check-in at Steigenberger Luxor</li><li>Free evening</li><li>Overnight at Steigenberger Luxor</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "a0ac19a9-eb3f-4293-b194-c7a3b463e4f6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 4: Dendera & Abydos, November 20th",
            "text": "<p>Immerse yourself in the divine beauty of the Hathor Temple, dedicated to the goddess of love and music, and explore the majestic Abydos Temple with its exquisite reliefs and captivating hieroglyphics.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Hathor_Temple.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions: </strong></h4><ul><li>Early breakfast</li><li>Drive to Dendera at 6:30 AM</li><li>Visit the Hathor Temple</li><li>Drive to Abydos</li><li>Lunch at Elshaht</li><li>Visit Abydos Temple</li><li>Private visit to Osirion</li><li>Overnight at Steigenberger Luxor</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "356bfe06-89e2-457a-a782-ada1263e0d36": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 5: West Bank, November 21st",
            "text": "<p>Explore the Valley of the Kings, the tombs of pharaohs, and the magnificent Ramesseum Temple. Witness artisans at work in the Alabaster Factory and behold the towering 700-ton Colossi of Memnon.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Ramesseum_Temple.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions: </strong></h4><ul><li>Optional Hot Air Balloon ride ($150)</li><li>Early breakfast</li><li>Drive to the West Bank of Luxor</li><li>Visit the famous Valley of the Kings with special access to the Tomb of Rakhmera</li><li>Explore Hatshepsut Temple</li><li>Visit the 700-ton Colossi of Memnon</li><li>Lunch</li><li>Return to Steigenberger Luxor</li><li>Overnight at Steigenberger Luxor</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "66db8b2b-fdc9-4434-bd63-38c72353b779": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 6: Cairo, November 22nd",
            "text": "<p>Explore the Egyptian Museum’s hallowed halls in Cairo.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Great_Pyramid_2.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>Inclusions: </strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Check out and drive to Luxor Airport</li><li>Fly to Cairo</li><li>Visit the Egyptian Museum</li><li>Lunch at Blue Nile Restaurant</li><li>Drive to Four Seasons Plaza and check-in</li><li>Overnight at Four Seasons Plaza</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_xgYrrg": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 7: Cairo, November 23rd",
            "text": "<p>Discover the southern entrance to the Step Pyramid at Sakkara, with its inscriptions and carvings. The Southern Shaft, a crucial architectural feature, guided priests and royalty into the afterlife.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sakkara-giza-egypt-050.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<h4><strong>Inclusions: </strong></h4><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Visit the Giza Plateau and Valley Temple</li><li>Drive to the Papyrus store</li><li>Farewell dinner at BBQ Mawlana</li><li>Private visit to the Great Pyramid from 7-9 PM</li><li>Overnight at Four Seasons Plaza</li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dd20cdd8-6dc0-42a2-91c4-c110a0716601": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Day 8: Cairo, November 24th",
            "text": "<p>As the sun sets on our journey, we bid farewell to the ancient wonders of Egypt, carrying with us the echoes of pharaohs’ whispers and the desert winds. Until we meet again beneath the shadow of your timeless monuments.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Great_Pyramid.jpg",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>Inclusions: </strong></p><ul><li>Breakfast</li><li>Check-out and departure<br/></li></ul>",
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
